  "description": "GOPXES crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H78 Br6 Cl2 Dy6 N6 O28 2+,2(Cl1 1-),4(C1 H4 O1),2(C2 H3 N1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.503-3.870 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.22-112.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(μ3-OH)2(L2)2(HL2)2(H2L2)2Cl2(EtOH)2]Cl2·4MeOH·2CH3CN·4H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
